no requests are reaching the core, even though everything is configured correctly.


 curl -s "https://dns.google/resolve?name=t.minxxxxx.com&type=SOA"
{"Status":3,"TC":false,"RD":true,"RA":true,"AD":false,"CD":false,"Question":[{"name":"t.minxxxxx.com.","type":6}],"Comment":"Response from 91.1xx.xxx.xxx."}root@ubuntu-4gb-nbg1-4:~#

as you can see in the test, the request to the domain receives a response; however, a status 3 indicates that no response was received from the core. The status must be zero for it to be correct.

